Ensure that when the python program runs, it reads the inputs, runs the algorithm and writes output to STDOUT.\n```python\n# YOUR CODE HERE\n```\n\n### Answer: (use the provided format with backticks)\n\n", "type": "request_span"}, "status": "active", "text": "The program is correct on all legal inputs of the statement.", "version": 1}, {"kind": "explicit", "priority": "functional", "requirement_id": "R3", "source": {"char_end": 1825, "char_start": 1799, "quote": "Input:\nsick fine\nOutput:\n2", "type": "request_span"}, "status": "active", "text": "Public example 1: output exactly the quoted output for the quoted input.", "version": 1}, {"kind": "explicit", "priority": "functional", "requirement_id": "R4", "source": {"char_end": 1863, "char_start": 1837, "quote": "Input:\nfine fine\nOutput:\n4", "type": "request_span"}, "status": "active", "text": "Public example 2: output exactly the quoted output for the quoted input.", "version": 1}], "request_sha": "b1b34bf132f791bc40339886af54bc491762e2e8c1971d4eee9d34f6fd3c97ce", "stop": null}, "kind": "requirements", "prev": "ba638387b104be94d42c753a62d14bbc3525c07e0adc1f571dfffa80162bfa3f", "seq": 2}
